// Signing.xcconfig
// Shared signing defaults for 술술 (Sulsul). Keep DEVELOPMENT_TEAM empty in this file.
//
// Your own Apple Developer Team ID goes in Signing.local.xcconfig next to this file.
// That file is git-ignored, so the ID is never committed.
//
// 1. Open https://developer.apple.com/account → Membership details.
// 2. Copy the 10-character Team ID.
// 3. Create Signing.local.xcconfig with this line, with no quotes:
//
//    DEVELOPMENT_TEAM = ABCDE12345
//
// `make local` overrides this with an empty team and ad-hoc or Apple Development
// signing, so a local build does not need a Team ID.
// `make release` and Xcode archives read this value. Do not put another person's
// Team ID in the project.

DEVELOPMENT_TEAM =

// Personal override. A later setting wins, so keep this line last. A missing file is fine.
#include? "Signing.local.xcconfig"
